      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is primarily correct. By having an actual verification in place and grouping all of the content in an area that can only be accessed by actual age verification. Will create a large impact in spotting out the cases on people that could also lie about their age when approaching certain content groups. This is why I presented this idea in this format rather than the current similar ones right now.",
