  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-30T20:27:16.363Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I noticed in the new SDK update that there were new tags involving NSFW. Is there a plan to roll out 18+ verification on VRChat w/ a badge on the profile, so when if a Club world is created? Could players opt in for it to fall under an 18+ Tab on the UI corresponding with anyone that has the badge? \n\nI find it a little better to group all of the NSFW community in one place with verification, so it protects minors from exposure of that Club environment. The many criminal cases on VRChat has caused a stain on this platform. Doing this reduces the significant number of law breaking cases. It allows VRChat to be safer and easier to weed out any lawbreakers in the Public space. Doing so, makes VRChat advertiser friendly to investors. With all the recent changes in supporting creators making content on VRChat. This helps them out too! \n\nThe benefits that this change brings:\n\n-Player Retention\n\n-The safety of minors\n\n-Investor friendly as well as Improvement of VRChat's public image to advertisers\n\n-Significantly reducing possible criminal cases that happen within the VRChat space\n\nMaking this change makes it easier for Club Owners/Club workers to operate under a new NSFW policy regulated and decided by the VRChat Team.",
